\pard\sb240\sa120\fs28\b 4.5 Answer Keys / Rationales\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa120\fs22 Online quizzes show rationales after attempt for Exam Prep. Downloadable answer keys and detailed rationales exist as protected resources. Legacy preserved-attempt gating (mark printable attempt) remains in class-cta-course-materials.php for some rationale downloads on programs that still use unlock_after_quiz_type in DB, but runtime exam prep download access is open when enrolled (Access Correction v1.0).\par
\pard\sb240\sa120\fs28\b 4.7 Study Toolkits and Downloads\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa120\fs22 Downloadable resources registered in cta_downloadable_resources and served via admin-post.php?action=cta_serve_resource (gated endpoint, not direct URLs). Includes printable workbooks (DOCX), answer keys, detailed rationales, remediation workbooks, performance analysis sheets, quick-reference sheets, study schedules, and printable flashcard HTML. Sync classes in includes/class-cta-*-sync.php seed resource rows per program.\par
